    <div class=3D"o-article__intro">
    <div class=3D"f-deck"><p>Impressionist artist Gustave Caillebotte (1848=
=E2=80=931894)=E2=80=94known and beloved by many Art Institute visitors for=
 his monumental painting <em>Paris Street; Rainy Day</em>=E2=80=94takes cen=
ter stage in this major exhibition exploring the very personal interests an=
d relationships that shaped his world.<br></p></div>
  </div>
 =20
