    <div class=3D"o-blocks">
        <p>Named a =E2=80=9CBest Art Book of 2024=E2=80=9D by the <em>New Y=
ork Times</em>, this richly illustrated catalogue paints a complex portrait=
 of Caillebotte, masculinity, and identity in late 19th-century France. Alo=
ngside paintings, drawings, and photographs, as well as an appendix featuri=
ng maps and new biographical research that sheds light on Caillebotte=E2=80=
=99s social network, this volume includes historically grounded thematic es=
says by curators and leading scholars.&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://www.artic.ed=
u/print-publications/225/gustave-caillebotte-painting-men" rel=3D"noopener =
noreferrer">Learn more</a>.</p>

